[
  {"text": "<10", "score": 1.0, "box": [575.25868881016, 415.11627909659984, 640.4942063496857, 438.8372090598482]},
  {"text": "15-MINUTE", "score": 1.0, "box": [610.8416978121379, 646.395349851881, 883.6447795809127, 687.9069763225375]},
  {"text": "GARLIC-", "score": 1.0, "box": [533.2549917375951, 732.8640308463671, 973.0925040893737, 826.7871313632768]},
  {"text": "BUTTER", "score": 1.0, "box": [533.4816244552447, 864.5493868137652, 955.0743554335056, 956.0320097778072]},
  {"text": "RAMEN", "score": 1.0, "box": [527.2872913270941, 993.7865476387943, 937.5466786788727, 1087.7250808767967]},
  {"text": "SERVES: 2", "score": 1.0, "box": [610.8417016130286, 1191.9767456495686, 830.2702620132263, 1227.5581386643853]},
  {"text": "PREP TIME: 5 minutes", "score": 1.0, "box": [533.745181739244, 1322.4418614838708, 901.436294634501, 1358.0232544986875]},
  {"text": "COOK TIME: 10 minutes", "score": 1.0, "box": [521.8841858648206, 1381.2500003005941, 913.2972911019748, 1417.678571729166]},
  {"text": "TOTAL TIME: 15 minutes", "score": 1.0, "box": [510.02316869409776, 1434.8809523224663, 919.2278067869831, 1470.6976731033387]},
  {"text": "As a kid who grew up in Cleveland, Ohio,", "score": 1.0, "box": [361.12390048183033, 1575.2179619275698, 1080.3473441577196, 1643.109520620139]},
  {"text": "I know all too well how brutal Midwest", "score": 1.0, "box": [355.83012010510447, 1660.4651164001236, 1079.351365164393, 1708.095237767442]},
  {"text": "winters can be. Often, on extra-cold days", "score": 1.0, "box": [349.48722143076145, 1732.0438142525206, 1074.118767873449, 1791.746191344791]},
  {"text": "I'd talk my mom into letting me stay home", "score": 1.0, "box": [343.96913754039997, 1814.345237587902, 1073.4208420858545, 1862.093022838248]},
  {"text": "from school because I was \"sick.\" She'd", "score": 1.0, "box": [343.96911322942907, 1891.249999752907, 1067.4903582887175, 1933.7499997529067]},
  {"text": "make a fire, bundle me up in blankets,", "score": 1.0, "box": [338.03862909084296, 1968.8372108016647, 1073.4208548813567, 2028.1395337797298]},
  {"text": "and flick on the TV. They were some of", "score": 1.0, "box": [332.1081145131013, 2045.9302325309382, 1073.4208615486746, 2093.6309514560508]},
  {"text": "the best days, and you know what made", "score": 1.0, "box": [332.1081318557667, 2122.9761896394257, 1061.5598364012212, 2170.5357134489495]},
  {"text": "them even better? The bowls of Top", "score": 1.0, "box": [330.894188221639, 2183.2212678888454, 1057.3848626287536, 2260.428276432314]},
  {"text": "Ramen and freshly popped popcorn that", "score": 1.0, "box": [326.1776221657467, 2276.785714272114, 1061.5598479562605, 2336.511626457056]},
  {"text": "my mom would make for lunch. It was", "score": 1.0, "box": [320.2471018506892, 2359.7619049550453, 1055.629327641203, 2407.6744184835966]},
  {"text": "the ultimate comfort-food lunch. These", "score": 1.0, "box": [318.9794033679068, 2427.804560334113, 1050.754353960792, 2495.3602585472363]},
  {"text": "days, my ideal bowl of ramen is salty, a", "score": 1.0, "box": [312.8751256501552, 2504.7432961414693, 1050.7848959070723, 2582.1983437943045]},
  {"text": "little spicy, veggie filled, noodley, and", "score": 1.0, "box": [312.4291554223967, 2584.7849404327158, 1044.963061054808, 2666.288120527843]},
  {"text": "generally just bursting with flavor. Noth-", "score": 1.0, "box": [308.3861163742409, 2674.4642859094683, 1043.7683421647546, 2728.0952382904206]},
  {"text": "ing like the Top Ramen I ate so much", "score": 1.0, "box": [302.455592995091, 2745.297618930648, 1037.8378187856047, 2811.0714284544574]},
  {"text": "of as a kid, but that's okay because my", "score": 1.0, "box": [300.536784068116, 2820.77455548895, 1039.3634268546773, 2909.86062895566]},
  {"text": "\"adult\" version takes maybe 10 minutes", "score": 1.0, "box": [293.2458301733973, 2880.8371373079194, 1040.3844788888123, 2999.616345173317]},
  {"text": "to make. We are ditching the broth and", "score": 1.0, "box": [288.74623227792677, 2984.2909740842515, 1033.2651304992708, 3071.3699445846523]},
  {"text": "adding some butter, plenty of garlic, and", "score": 1.0, "box": [288.3716199429031, 3062.8860505279904, 1033.4704959310454, 3155.4764170731682]},
  {"text": "tons of fresh basil. My suggestion? Take", "score": 1.0, "box": [284.66412347889843, 3148.953490903788, 1031.9073300006376, 3220.116276933422]},
  {"text": "yourself back to the age of twelve, play", "score": 1.0, "box": [282.6718799187355, 3231.3586714077437, 1027.5749184562849, 3315.088695109729]},
  {"text": "hooky from work, make garlic-butter", "score": 1.0, "box": [275.3608230943085, 3301.7824194658956, 1028.0058947346247, 3410.586812734662]},
  {"text": "ramen noodles, and watch your favorite", "score": 1.0, "box": [276.5961365987935, 3395.745747387726, 1027.2382438122322, 3482.3779795996115]},
  {"text": "old-school TV shows all day long.", "score": 1.0, "box": [270.1445887702365, 3460.433775697912, 887.039475133873, 3563.9880367692535]},
  {"text": "6 tablespoons salted butter", "score": 1.0, "box": [1275.0579342354447, 616.2499995511499, 1779.1505725753655, 664.1860462423178]},
  {"text": "4 garlic cloves, minced or grated", "score": 1.0, "box": [1273.9435993535192, 690.752545376528, 1869.0466749464044, 750.7765661619055]},
  {"text": "1(1-inch) piece of fresh ginger,", "score": 1.0, "box": [1267.6473612848158, 763.5302738795106, 1828.156872154381, 829.7289657471574]},
  {"text": "peeled and grated", "score": 1.0, "box": [1269.1274285746263, 824.3023259289155, 1613.0965182485393, 866.1904752812165]},
  {"text": "2 to 3 cups finely chopped, leafy", "score": 1.0, "box": [1267.8138196327684, 892.2678851150383, 1857.638300858065, 955.5197359471144]},
  {"text": "dark greens, such as spinach or", "score": 1.0, "box": [1269.1274297888401, 942.9069765053437, 1850.3165972789589, 996.7261903271183]},
  {"text": "kale", "score": 1.0, "box": [1263.1969099064886, 990.3488366879147, 1346.2239371421606, 1037.790696614411]},
  {"text": "2 packs of brown rice ramen", "score": 1.0, "box": [1263.1969325044454, 1073.3720932925655, 1785.081072820651, 1121.1904761007058]},
  {"text": "noodles, seasoning packet", "score": 1.0, "box": [1251.3359118107348, 1126.2499995511498, 1755.4285501506558, 1174.1860462423178]},
  {"text": "discarded", "score": 1.0, "box": [1263.196914121394, 1174.1860474809635, 1452.9729763743585, 1209.7674404957806]},
  {"text": "3 tablespoons low-sodium", "score": 1.0, "box": [1974.8571628405061, 634.4642861894353, 2449.2972875934706, 676.0465102178864]},
  {"text": "soy sauce", "score": 1.0, "box": [1974.6830819035126, 692.8842714058082, 2164.807263598177, 730.3715437137944]},
  {"text": "\u00bc cup fresh basil, chopped,", "score": 1.0, "box": [1974.8571583081014, 758.9285710402484, 2490.810808258694, 800.5813945565492]},
  {"text": "plus more for serving", "score": 1.0, "box": [1974.857152412878, 806.488096153028, 2360.3397672844194, 854.0476199625514]},
  {"text": "2 fried eggs, for serving (optional)", "score": 1.0, "box": [1974.8571673615565, 883.3928565321505, 2609.420840780529, 931.0465110620853]},
  {"text": "Toasted sesame seeds, for serving", "score": 1.0, "box": [1974.8571540916478, 960.2976189145969, 2597.559846779395, 1002.2093014295147]},
  {"text": "(optional)", "score": 1.0, "box": [1974.312379877319, 1005.8569489040563, 2165.177961646094, 1057.8639798906602]},
  {"text": "Freshly ground pepper", "score": 1.0, "box": [1974.857135401709, 1084.7619040160916, 2401.8532754708785, 1132.6744175446433]},
  {"text": "1. In a large skillet over medium heat, melt the butter, then add the", "score": 1.0, "box": [1251.3359195262017, 1286.8604668119401, 2520.4632663641464, 1352.0930193857344]},
  {"text": "garlic and ginger, stirring constantly. Cook until the garlic is", "score": 1.0, "box": [1298.1500155700198, 1362.4411197859524, 2449.8984098387946, 1432.3826441099154]},
  {"text": "fragrant and beginning to caramelize, 3 to 4 minutes. Add the greens", "score": 1.0, "box": [1292.1741749544299, 1428.717002507194, 2615.8727915552204, 1498.650436039909]},
  {"text": "and cook until wilted, 2 to 3 minutes more.", "score": 1.0, "box": [1292.3118350207194, 1497.3857615586787, 2105.995135415976, 1554.0802576907572]},
  {"text": "2. Meanwhile, cook the noodles according to package directions. Drain.", "score": 1.0, "box": [1250.6461622796435, 1577.104264413083, 2621.8542897499988, 1651.2279480700481]},
  {"text": "3. Add the noodles and soy sauce to the skillet, tossing with the garlic", "score": 1.0, "box": [1244.8064289566773, 1664.6355880888607, 2586.2219427906693, 1732.5645280898489]},
  {"text": "butter. Remove from the heat and add the basil, tossing to combine.", "score": 1.0, "box": [1292.03809518888, 1726.5120426309186, 2598.349730564374, 1802.9192864957954]},
  {"text": "4. Divide the noodles between two bowls and top each with a fried egg,", "score": 1.0, "box": [1244.4791878654084, 1800.8612167597428, 2628.3314605926807, 1892.1449745598898]},
  {"text": "sesame seeds, and more basil, if desired. Season with pepper.", "score": 1.0, "box": [1286.277482135032, 1881.657411240747, 2479.760189644913, 1953.1878418982697]},
  {"text": "VEGETARIAN", "score": 1.0, "box": [2370.647905617021, 3681.5060999203, 2640.833274935203, 3733.074020196397]},
  {"text": "145", "score": 1.0, "box": [2716.169887105141, 3700.4651172484055, 2781.4054046446663, 3736.0465102632224]}
]